I just want to share a quick reflection

48
00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:20.340
about my Santacruzan experience and how I can
connect it to our subject, understanding the
self.

49
00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:27.340
Honestly, at first, I thought this event was
just about preparing myself, my makeup, my
hair,

50
00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.340
and then joining the procession.

51
00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:33.340
But after everything, after I experienced
everything,

